%% Mermaid source equivalent of architecture.svg (render at mermaid.live)
flowchart LR
  U[You: trusted channel] --> S[Secret scrubber]
  W[Web / docs / tool output: UNTRUSTED data] --> S
  S --> M[Open-source LLM: proposer only]
  M -->|JSON proposal| P1[1 Strict schema]
  U -.->|only grounding source| P2
  P1 --> P2[2 Grounding + ambiguity]
  P2 -->|ask| U
  P2 --> P3[3 Deterministic tx builder]
  P3 --> P4[4 Decode round-trip + simulate]
  P4 --> P5[5 Policy engine]
  PJ[(policy.json: user-owned)] --> P5
  P5 --> P6[6 Approval gate]
  P6 -->|decoded summary| C[Confirmation prompt]
  C -->|approve exact digest| P6
  P6 -->|one-time token| SG[Signer + encrypted keystore]
  PJ -.->|re-check from disk| SG
  SG -->|raw signed tx| E[(Ethereum: local EVM / testnet)]
  UC[User-only commands] -.-> PJ
